  "releaseNotes": "Point getters return both voxel values and compressed leaf LOD levels for trees, spans, compiled lookups, and channel-aware worlds, including generic variants. LOD 0 represents one voxel; LOD N represents an aligned uniform cube of side 2^N. Dense storage returns LOD 0. Serialized formats remain compatible.",
